---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home" description="Original fiction film stories. Watch the clip, read the real story.">
  <p><span class="tag">Original fiction</span></p>
  <h1>Watch the clip.<br />Read the real story.</h1>
  <p>
    Every film here is an original story, made as a short cinematic video
    clip — and told in full, in writing, episode by episode. The video is
    the trailer. The writing is the film.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href="/films/ember-blade/episode-1/">Start with Episode 1 of Ember Blade</a>
  </p>

  <h2>All Films</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Ember Blade</h3>
      <p>Retro 90s anime, feudal Japan. Ryu, 19, the last fire-sword
      swordsman, returns to a village that has burned twice — and the
      man who burned it is waiting.</p>
      <p><a href="/films/ember-blade/">Film page</a> · <a href="/films/ember-blade/episode-1/">Episode 1</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>I Married a Stranger for $100,000</h3>
      <p>Romance. Maya, a nurse, signs a $100,000 contract marriage with
      Noah, a billionaire — and on day 29 he proposes for real.</p>
      <p><em>Coming soon to the blog.</em></p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Restoring a 1969 Mustang</h3>
      <p>Cinematic ASMR restoration. A faded candy-apple-red 1969 Mustang,
      abandoned for 30 years, brought back to life — flat tires, broken
      headlight, plate HIST 69 and all.</p>
      <p><em>Coming soon to the blog.</em></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Watch</strong> the clip at the top of each episode.</li>
    <li><strong>Read</strong> the full story underneath it.</li>
    <li><strong>Continue</strong> — every episode ends on a cliffhanger.</li>
  </ol>
</Layout>
